            "review_text": "Ramona L\nOrtonville, Michigan84 contributions\n1\nChange of Pace\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThe Czech beer is quite good, as you would expect. We tried the salami appetizer, and it was pretty good. Three of us had the chicken schnitzel and I had the pork schnitzel. I would say it was decent food. The chicken was more successful than my pork, which I found too heavily breaded, a little greasy, and the breading didn't stick well to the meat. It was a nice change from all the Asian food.\nRead more\nValue\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 23, 2019",
