            "review_text": "Kebe14\nWinchester, United Kingdom47 contributions\n0\nGreat beer, great food\nJul 2017 • Couples\nWe came here twice, once just for beers at lunch time when it was packed with vietnamese workers who went there for their lunch break and once for dinner. A half litre of czech draft beer cost us 50.000 vnd which was reasonable. We also came back for dinner and a few beers on a Saturday night. The food was great (we had the Czech goulash and the pork schnitzel for about 80.000 vnd each) and we were not disappointed. Not a lot of tourists here but would definitely recommend.\nRead more\nWritten July 16, 2017",
